# Helm on Minerva's Jetson (helm --on-robot, ops.helm_service): what the robot's system Python 3.10 lacks.
# The robot's own numpy, scipy, paramiko, msgpack, pyzmq and h5py serve the rest; the 3D view's meshes are
# converted on the build PC (ops.helm_robot meshes), so no trimesh. Same aiohttp as requirements/dev.lock.
# Regenerate (docs/development/HELM_ON_JETSON.md):
#   uv pip compile requirements/helm-robot.in --python-version 3.10 --python-platform aarch64-manylinux_2_17 --generate-hashes -o requirements/helm-robot.lock
aiohttp==3.14.4
